626:  * Same temp + fsync + rename guarantee as writeStateAtomic, but for
627:  * already-serialized content (e.g. markdown) that must not be re-encoded
628:  * as JSON. Readers always see either the previous complete file or the
629:  * new one, never a torn mid-write tail.
